 is forming between Nanjing, Maanshan and Wuhu, comprising over 10.66 million inhabitants.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Wuhu_Skyline%2C_December_2019.jpg/330px-Wuhu_Skyline%2C_December_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wuhu"},"twins":["Q200251","Q6259","Q489839","Q494728","Q5627"],"climate":{"temp":[3.3,6.2,11,16.9,21.9,25.4,28.5,27.9,23.7,18.1,11.9,5],"rain":[72,91,109,141,155,242,255,171,111,65,74,54],"cloud":[65,69,66,68,71,77,72,67,64,58,56,57]},"land":true}